  "body": "Beulah is traditionally associated with a promised land, a place of beauty, belonging, and contentment. At 45 Beulah Avenue, that sentiment takes shape in a boutique collection of standalone 3 & 4 bedroom homes, walking distance to school and beach. Brand-new standalone builds — Choose from thoughtfully planned layouts ranging from 122.7m² to 152.3m² with a 10-Year Master Build Guarantee.\r\n\r\nThe exterior combines walnut-toned Abodo Vulcan timber with James Hardie fibre-cement cladding, while the interior features a beautifully crafted vintage villa style.\r\nHerringbone timber flooring flows through the living spaces, complemented by French-inspired picture-frame wall mouldings, ceiling coves and French-style architraves that bring depth and character rarely found in new builds.\r\n\r\n• Designer kitchens feature beautifully detailed cabinetry and luxury stone surfaces\r\n• Full suite of Miele kitchen appliances\r\n• Rose gold Italian-inspired tapware, Spanish tiles, sculptural mirrors and stylish pendant lights carry the design language\r\n• Abundant glazing and skylights draw natural light deep into the interiors\r\n• Motion-sensor stair lights make every step feel like a fairytale\r\n• Moments from the beach, local shops, cafés and highly regarded schools\r\n• Standalone 3 & 4 bedroom homes from 122.7m² to 152.3m²\r\n• 10-Year Master Build Guarantee\r\n\r\nCoastal living is close at hand, with sought-after schooling including Browns Bay School, Murrays Bay Intermediate and Rangitoto College. It is that rare balance - peaceful enough to retreat from the day, yet close to everything that makes the Bays such a desirable place to call home.\r\n\r\nStandalone. Modern Villa. Designer Detail. Coastal Living.\r\nSome homes look good in photographs. Beulah is one you need to step inside to appreciate.",
